url: "https://github.com/KaiKai0714/layout-abi-lab"
abstract: >-
  A reproducibility artifact for characterizing how logical length, physical layout,
  and operand-pointer alignment affect downstream GPU vendor GEMM kernel selection.
  Explicit layout repair is used as a causal intervention and secondary cost-benefit
  experiment rather than assumed to be universally profitable.
